open: https://start.1password.com/open/i?a=AE2EDEVACCOUNT000000000001&v=vE2EWEBDEV0000000000000001&i=iE2EWEBDEV0000000000000001&h=e2e.1password.com
pasting into the 1Password app turns line breaks into spaces and drops a trailing newline; store it exactly with opv set web/TLS_CERTIFICATE --env dev --from-file <PATH>
no desktop to open it on here: open the link above yourself

